          "_key": "k000kk",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "What \"ready for kindergarten\" means"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k000kl",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k000km",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Kindergarten readiness is more than ABCs. Teachers also look for children who can sit for a story, follow a routine, ask for help, take care of their things and get along with others. We work on all of it, every day."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
