          "text": "Many Vineland children go on to Vineland Public Schools elementary schools such as Gloria M. Sabater, Pauline J. Petway, Marie Durand or Dr. William Mennies Elementary School. Kindergarten registration is run by the school district, so check its website in the spring before your child starts. If your child will stay with us before or after school, our "
